Read `docs/operations/deployment-runbook.md` and
`docs/architecture/11-deployment-architecture.md` before changing deployment,
runtime configuration, or operational scripts.

Never expose, copy into source control, or modify secret values. Production
access, deploys, provider changes, infrastructure changes, and production
migration commands require explicit user authorization and the runbook's
preflight/rollback steps.
